 the $130 million in SG&A savings we expect for the full year.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LULU 2020 Q4","e":"lulu","d":"2021-03-30","l":"dtc","r":"analyst","s":"Matthew Boss","x":"…a follow-up on SG&A. Meghan, so outside of MIRROR and the pull forward that you've cited of the DTC investments, I guess my question is on an underlying basis, is there any change to the annual plan, I think that you laid out at the Analyst Day, for modest SG&A leverage on low teens revenues…","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LULU 2021 Q1","e":"lulu","d":"2021-06-03","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Meghan Frank","x":"And then we're reiterating our guidance for -- or our guidance color for MIRROR for 2021, revenue range of $2.50 to $2.75, and EPS dilution of 3% to 5%.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LULU 2021 Q2","e":"lulu","d":"2021-09-08","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Meghan Frank","x":"Strong guest response to our merchandise offering and improving store trend and continued strength in e-commerce fueled our growth, and contributed to our increased outlook for the year, which I will take you through in a moment.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LULU 2021 Q2","e":"lulu","d":"2021-09-08","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"John Kernan","x":"Meghan, maybe just a quick follow-up on the increased outlook for airfreight.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LULU 2021 Q3","e":"lulu","d":"2021-12-09","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Adrienne Yih-Tennant","x":"Calvin, I wanted to start by talking about average initial retails, what you think the pricing power there is?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LULU 2021 Q3","e":"lulu","d":"2021-12-09","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Kimberly Greenberger","x":"Would you think that, that would be an appropriate way to also raise price to the end consumer?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LULU 2021 Q3","e":"lulu","d":"2021-12-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Kimberly Greenberger","x":"If I back that inbound airfreight charge or cost out, am I right in doing so to get to, let's say, a gross merchandise margin increase in the quarter of 180 basis points?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LULU 2021 Q4","e":"lulu","d":"2022-03-29","l":"dtc","r":"analyst","s":"John Kernan","x":"Meghan, did you give guidance for DTC in terms of the full year revenue guidance?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LULU 2021 Q4","e":"lulu","d":"2022-03-29","l":"dtc","r":"analyst","s":"John Kernan","x":"So maybe if you could talk to DTC growth within guidance and store productivity within full year guidance and then what you're seeing from some of the newer stores that are coming online in terms of productivity?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LULU 2021 Q4","e":"lulu","d":"2022-03-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Calvin McDonald","x":"We are taking modest selective price increases over the course of the year.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LULU 2022 Q1","e":"lulu","d":"2022-06-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Meghan Frank","x":"In terms of pricing, we're taking modest price increases on about 10% of our assortment.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LULU 2022 Q1","e":"lulu","d":"2022-06-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Meghan Frank","x":"And we have started taking some price increases in Q1, as I said, modest and will be less than 10% of our assortment.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LULU 2022 Q1","e":"lulu","d":"2022-06-02","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Meghan Frank","x":"And then we also have increased our outlook for the year in terms of air freight pressure to 30 basis points.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LULU 2022 Q2","e":"lulu","d":"2022-09-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Calvin McDonald","x":"As you know, we were -- we took modest price increases on a small percentage of our range of product.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LULU 2022 Q2","e":"lulu","d":"2022-09-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Lorraine Maikis","x":"Can you talk a little bit about the reaction to the limited price increases you've taken so far this year?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LULU 2022 Q3","e":"lulu","d":"2022-12-07","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Calvin McDonald","x":"We have pricing power.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LULU 2022 Q3","e":"lulu","d":"2022-12-07","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Calvin McDonald","x":"But absolutely, it's not a reflection of what we believe the pricing power of the brand is.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LULU 2024 Q1","e":"lulu","d":"2024-06-05","l":"dtc","r":"analyst","s":"John Kernan","x":"I guess, how should we think about -- there's a DTC platform with tremendous scale, e-commerce with tremendous scale.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LULU 2024 Q1","e":"lulu","d":"2024-06-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Brooke Roach","x":"I'll pass it on.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LULU 2024 Q1","e":"lulu","d":"2024-06-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Calvin McDonald","x":"And under Nikki's proven leadership, the merchant and the brand teams will be more fully integrated, which will streamline decision-making and ensure we show up powerfully and consistently for our guests across all markets.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LULU 2024 Q2","e":"lulu","d":"2024-08-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Brooke Roach","x":"I will pass it on.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LULU 2024 Q2","e":"lulu","d":"2024-08-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Meghan Frank","x":"So the relationship with the two quarters has not changed, but we have lowered our outlook on the aggregate water line for the second half.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LULU 2024 Q3","e":"lulu","d":"2024-12-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Meghan Frank","x":"And then, obviously, if tariffs were levied on imports from all countries into the U.S., that would obviously have a more significant impact on our costs.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LULU 2024 Q3","e":"lulu","d":"2024-12-05","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Sharon Zackfia","x":"I guess I'm curious, given the election paradigm in the U.S., how you're thinking about any potential tariff impact as it relates to next year?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LULU 2024 Q4","e":"lulu","d":"2025-03-27","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Meghan Frank","x":"We expect the decrease will be driven by deleverage on fixed costs, FX headwinds, and the impact of increased tariffs related to China and Mexico.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LULU 2024 Q4","e":"lulu","d":"2025-03-27","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Meghan Frank","x":"As I mentioned, we are seeing headwinds from foreign exchange and tariffs, while also absorbing some additional costs relative to last year as we layer back in certain expenses, including store labor hours, travel, and incentive comp.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LULU 2025 Q1","e":"lulu","d":"2025-06-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Calvin McDonald","x":"Next, I'll provide insights into the planning and strategies we're deploying related to the increase in tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/06/05/lululemon-lulu-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LULU 2025 Q1","e":"lulu","d":"2025-06-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Calvin McDonald","x":"I would now like to talk for a moment about the current environment related to tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/06/05/lululemon-lulu-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LULU 2025 Q1","e":"lulu","d":"2025-06-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Meghan Frank","x":"We are planning to take strategic price increases, looking item by item across our assortment as we typically do, and it will be price increases on a small portion of our assortment, and they will be modest in nature.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/06/05/lululemon-lulu-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LULU 2025 Q1","e":"lulu","d":"2025-06-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Brooke Roach","x":"I'll pass it on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/06/05/lululemon-lulu-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LULU 2025 Q3","e":"lulu","d":"2025-12-11","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Calvin McDonald","x":"…high-value guests in new ways and better aligning our brand and marketing activities with product inflections and drops, and enterprise efficiency, ensuring we are operating as efficiently as possible as we work to inflect the U.S. business, particularly in light of the new tariff environment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/12/12/lululemon-lulu-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LULU 2025 Q3","e":"lulu","d":"2025-12-11","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Meghan Frank","x":"This work stream is not new for us, however, in a world with higher tariffs and the removal of the de minimis provision.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/12/12/lululemon-lulu-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LULU 2025 Q4","e":"lulu","d":"2026-03-17","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Meghan Frank","x":"And then in terms of CapEx, we do have some investments in the AI space, shoring up our data and baseline so that we can move off of that.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/18/lululemon-lulu-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LULU 2025 Q4","e":"lulu","d":"2026-03-17","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Meghan Frank","x":"While we have always been prudent with regard to expenses, we have been particularly vigilant over the last 2 years as sales trends in the U.S. have faced headwinds and tariff policy has added pressure.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/18/lululemon-lulu-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LULU 2025 Q4","e":"lulu","d":"2026-03-17","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Meghan Frank","x":"Our gross margin decreased 550 basis points relative to last year and was driven primarily by the following: a 560 basis point decline in overall product margin, driven predominantly by tariff impact and higher markdowns.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/18/lululemon-lulu-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LULU 2025 Q4","e":"lulu","d":"2026-03-17","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Andre Maestrini","x":"So yes, as said, everything we are working on developing new styles and newness at the global level will also benefit all our markets to keep driving the focus and engaging the guest on full-price realization.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/18/lululemon-lulu-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LULU 2025 Q4","e":"lulu","d":"2026-03-17","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Laurent Vasilescu","x":"But for the audience, the North American full-price realization, can you maybe just unpack a little bit better in terms of -- like I think you mentioned 1Q is better than 4Q.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/18/lululemon-lulu-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LULU 2026 Q1","e":"lulu","d":"2026-06-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Meghan Frank","x":"A 33 basis point decline in overall product margin, driven predominantly by tariff impact and markdowns.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/06/04/lululemon-lulu-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"LULU 2026 Q1","e":"lulu","d":"2026-06-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Meghan Frank","x":"Tariffs had a gross negative impact of 280 basis points in the quarter offset by 100 basis points related to our enterprise efficiency initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/06/04/lululemon-lulu-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"LULU 2026 Q2","e":"lulu","d":"2026-09-03","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Meghan Frank","x":"Gross margin increased 200 basis points compared to last year and was driven primarily by the following: 560 basis points of benefit from IEEPA tariff refunds, a 150 basis point decline in overall product margin driven predominantly by tariff impact and markdowns.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/09/09/lululemon-lulu-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LULU 2026 Q2","e":"lulu","d":"2026-09-03","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Meghan Frank","x":"Tariffs, exclusive of the refund, had a gross negative impact of 160 basis points in the quarter, offset by 100 basis points related to our enterprise efficiency initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/09/09/lululemon-lulu-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}